      "NOT FOR SALE",
      "مقید کرنا",
      "These compounds exist as a stable compounds in the solid state and retain their identity in the solution. For example, when potassium ferrocyanide is dissolved in water, the aqueous solution does not show the characteristic test of Fe and CN ions.",
      "The physical and chemical properties of the aqueous solution is entirely different from those of free Fe2* and CN ions.",
      "بالکل پورا کا پورا سر آسم",
      "In coordination compounds, a central metal atom or ion is bonded to the surrounding electron-pair donors called ligands, through a coordinate bond. These compounds are also known as metal complexes because of the presence of complex metal ions. Some common examples of coordination compounds are,",
