        "theory": "in\n5. Define functional group. How organic compounds are classified on the basis of\nfunctional group?\n6. Give old classification of organic compounds based on arrangement of carbon\natoms in the molecule.\nProject\nav\nPerform tests for detection of carbon, hydrogen and nitrogen in Urea (or any other available organic compound containing C, H and N) by following the procedure discussed in section\n15.7.\n¥\n98\nH\nH\nUnit\n16",
        "content": "in<br>5. Define functional group. How organic compounds are classified on the basis of<br>functional group?<br>6. Give old classification of organic compounds based on arrangement of carbon<br>atoms in the molecule.<br>Project<br>av<br>Perform tests for detection of carbon, hydrogen and nitrogen in Urea (or any other available organic compound containing C, H and N) by following the procedure discussed in section<br>15.7.<br>¥<br>98<br>H<br>H<br>Unit<br>16",
