      "(trigonal planar)",
      "Because the rate-limiting step involves unimolecular ionization of the alkyl halide, the rate equation is first-order. The rate depends only on the concentration of the alkyl halide and not on the concentration of the base.",
      "rate = k [R-X] or rate = k [(CH),C-Br]",
      "17.1.7.3 E2 Mechanism",
      "This is a bimolecular elimination process, with",
      "E 2",
