        "sciNote": "b. glycogen\nc. pectin\n3. The glycosidic linkage is present between the molecules of\na. glucose\nc. fatty acid\n4. Steroid belong to family of\na. carbohydrates\nc. lipids\nd. chitin\nFor Z\nb. glycine d. none of these\n& non\nb, proteins\nd. enzymes\n5. Protein present in haemoglobin has the structure known as\na. primary structure.\nc. tertiary structure.\nb. secondary structure.\nd. quaternary structure.\n6. Which carbohydrate does not conform the general formula C,(H,O),?\na. Deoxyribose b. Ribose\nc. Glucose\n7. Ethanol is produced from starch by the process of\na. hydrolysis\nc. decomposition\nb. hydrogenation.\nd. Fructose\nin\nd. fermentation\n306\n8. Human are unable to digest\na. glucose\nc. starch\nb. cellulose\nNOT FOR SALE\nd. denatured protein\n9. Which one of the following term is not related to term aldohexose?\na. Aldehyde\nb. Ketone\nc. Six\n10. Slow healing of wounds is due the deficiency of\na. Ca\nb. P\n11. RNA is primarily seen in\na. nucleus\nc. cell wall\nd. Sugar\nc. Zn\nd. Fe\nb. cytoplasm\nd. cell membrane\n12. In which of following disaccharides both the basic structural units are the same?\na. Maltose\nb. Lactose\n13. In competitive inhibition, the inhibitor\na. competes with enzyme.\nc. binds with substrate.\nc. Sucrose\nd. All of these\nb. irreversibly binds with the enzyme. d. competes with substrate.\n14. In DNA, adenine forms a complementary pair with which other nitrogen base?\na. Uracil\nb. Cytosine\n15. Proteins are polymers of\na. glucose\nc. amino acids\nc. Thymine d. Guanine\nb. disulphide bridges\nd."
