          "sourceChemicalEquation": "H₂C=CH₂ + Br₂ → H₂C⁺—CH₂Br (−Br⁻) → cyclic bromonium ion; +H₂O → BrCH₂—CH₂OH₂⁺; −H⁺ → BrCH₂—CH₂OH"
