      "theory": "Exercise\nQI. Choose the correct one from the given options.\n1. The monomer pair required for the formation of Nylon 6,6 is\na. hexamethylene diamine + adipic acid.\nb. hexamethylene diamine + sebacoyl chloride.\nc. hexamethylene diamine + decanoic acid.\nd. hexamethylene amine + ethanedioic acid,\n2. Which one is true for DDT?\na. An antibiotic\nc. An antiseptic\n3. The term black gold is used for\na. coal\nc. petroleum\n4. All are petrochemicals except\na. ethylene oxide\nc. cellulose\n5. Multipart adhesive is an example of\na. reactive adhesives.\nc. hot adhesives.\n6. Nail polish removers are mainly composed of\na. propyne\nc. propanal\n7. In the process of cracking\na. small molecule unite together.\nb. large molecules unite together.\nc. large molecules are broken down.\nd. small and large molecules unite together.\n8. Rexine is the manipulated form of\na. plastic (PVC)\nc. lipstick\nb. Non pollutant\nd. Non-degradable\nb. carbon black\nd.\ncoal tar\nb. polypropylene\nd. cyclohexane\nb. contact adhesives.\nd. pressure sensitive adhesives.\nb. propanone\nd. propene\nawaz e\nb. nylon\nd. nail polish\n9. Identify the petrochemical which is not obtained from benzene\na. alkyl benzenes\nc. nitrobenzene\nb. cyclohexane\n332\nd. vinyl chloride\n10. Which of the following is condensation polymer\na. PVC. c. nylon.\nNOT FOR SALE\nb. polythene.\nd. none of these,\n11. (-NH-(CH2)6-CONHCO(CH2)4CO-), is an example of\na.\naddition polymer.\nb. thermosetting polymer.\nc. condensation copolymer (Nylon-6,6). 12. Which one of the following is synthetic polymer?\na. cellulose\nc. silk\nd. homo-polymer.\nb. starch\nd. polythene\n13. Hair dyes are commonly classified into groups\na. 3\nb. 4\n14. All are synthetic adhesives except\na. casein glues\nc. cyanoacrylates\n15. Acrylate base polymers are\na. drying adhesives.\nb. pressure sensitive adhesives.\nc. contact adhesives.\nd. hot adhesives.\nc. 5\nb. polyurethanes\nd. polyimides\nQ2. Write short answers of the following questions.\nDifferentiate between reactive and non-reactive adhesives.\nHow nail-polish remover removes the nail polish?\nd. 6\nWhy temporary hair dyes are removed with single shampooing?\niv. Write down at least four uses of PVC.\nWhat is the difference between petrochemical and chemicals derived from them? Differentiate between addition and condensation polymers.\nMi. How would you justify that non-acetone base nail polish remover is better than\nacetone base nail polish remover.\nvi. How important the safety consideration for the workers in industry?\nWhat is main goal of petroleum refining?\nQ3. Write detail answers of the following questions.\n(a). Explain the Petrochemical Process Technology (b). Describe the different types of cracking in detail. (a). Discuss the preparation and applications of lipsticks. (b). Write down in detail the composition of nail polish.\n333\nNOT FOR SALE\n(a). What are adhesives? Classify the adhesives on the basis of origin and\nreactiveness.\n(b). Discuss the importance of adhesive in our daily life.\n4. (a). Write down the raw materials in Pakistan for various chemical and\npetrochemical industries.\n(b). Discuss the Safety Considerations in Process Industries in detail.\n5 (a). Explain the fractional distillation of petroleum.\n(b). Discuss in detail the importance of the chemical industries in the economy of\nPakistan.\nProject\nUse the library or internet to research the petrochemicals. Write a newspaper article about petrochemicals. Make sure that the following questions are answered in the article.\n1. What are the origin of petroleum?\n2. How petroleum is refined? Also, give a touch to the different fractions.\n3. How petrochemicals are produced?\nWrite down the names of some famous petrochemicals.\n$. What are the functions of petrochemicals?\n6. Why the petrochemicals are so much important in our life?\nawaz e in\n334\nNOT FORSALE\nUnit\n23",
